+# Complete Code Changes Reference
+
+## File 1: `packages/frai-core/src/eval/reporters.js`
+
+### Required Change: Add Thresholds Section to toMarkdown()
+
+**Location:** Lines 7-41, insert after line 37
+
+**What This Does:**
+- Renders markdown table with threshold results
+- Shows metric name, minimum threshold, actual score, and pass/fail status
+- Handles null scores by displaying "n/a"
+- Only renders section if thresholds exist
+
+**Code to Insert (after line 37):**
+```javascript
+  // Add Thresholds section if thresholds were evaluated
+  if (report.thresholds && report.thresholds.length > 0) {
+    lines.push('## Thresholds');
