+
+**Status:** Markdown reporter needs enhancement
+
+### Modification 1: Add Thresholds Section to toMarkdown()
+
+- [ ] Open file: `packages/frai-core/src/eval/reporters.js`
+- [ ] Locate: `export function toMarkdown(report)` (line 7)
+- [ ] Find: The closing `});` of `report.metrics.forEach()` (line 37)
+- [ ] After line 37, before `lines.push('---');` (line 38)
+- [ ] Insert the new Thresholds section code:
